{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_title", "source_sha256": "b210a6d4454e27d37789d8fb27b064f09c13c770a096a007190a85484b11dd82", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」萩原雪歩", "zh": "“与你相遇之后”萩原雪步", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1a6fd3834390ece4a00ae14608b53d74161fc4ba5e21f4c70d3d5b111acadc0b", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n雪歩とプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "在Destiny公演前夕，\n雪步与制作人回顾相遇至今\n一路走来的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb22bf54cf0ea20710b1a160a107eee452d7eec01f159e21cb9ba70f29897a9d", "ja": "（765PRO ALLSTARSに、ゴールデンの人気歌番組\nからオファーが届いた。公演の宣伝のチャンスだが…）", "zh": "（765PRO ALLSTARS收到了黄金档热门歌唱节目的邀约。这是宣传公演的机会，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "20db372f3bf2f453df4961d73738af3da81c47bf889f0ac9b9e0c6fd659aaf52", "ja": "えええええええええぇぇぇっ！？\nわ、私一人だけで、出演するんですかぁ！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶——！？\n我、我一个人出演吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1002_p", "source_sha256": "04e4f5a28808135cc9336ad0dbbf6e35c9b0d6d506e7084a2e15252ee9eeebc4", "ja": "みんな、どうしてもスケジュールが合わなくて。\n雪歩だけが駆けつけでどうにか、って感じなんだ。", "zh": "大家的档期实在排不开。\n也就雪步你能赶过来帮上忙，大概是这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0ce1a1d0570cd152f369b32977aaca99c86d7b335b40e71d8b5dbb829925cb10", "ja": "でもでも、みんなにオファーを出したのに、出るのが\n私だけ、って……うう、ガッカリされますよね……？", "zh": "可是可是，明明给大家都发了邀请，结果却只有我一个人出场……呜呜，肯定会让对方失望的吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1004_p", "source_sha256": "442d8578e49dfc8d359ff42ea21790cf0d44d50a374b74eb03409e466107735c", "ja": "されないよ。急な話なのは先方も承知で、「今から一人\nだけでも都合が合えば」っていうオファーだから。", "zh": "不会的。对方也知道这事很突然，毕竟提出的要求就是“如果现在起哪怕只有一个人有空也行”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5eb964983cd599395cb258caf53bf978c48123245941522292344a55cd92246c", "ja": "むしろ、雪歩が出られるって聞いたら\n小躍りするんじゃないかな？", "zh": "倒不如说，听说雪步能参加的话，他们应该会高兴得手舞足蹈吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "21b34e7e850c642ec364cc65f4118c070dbe1f76de5953530fa3e6ddbed6fb46", "ja": "そ、そう……ですか？\nううっ、でもでも…………はっ。", "zh": "是、是吗……？\n呜，可是可是…………啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f3e9f9c4ee7ba1092eb08e5ba49595942dfb8289342ec36e25cfd8ae26838e22", "ja": "ううん。「でも」ばっかりじゃ、ダメですよね。\n私だけ……私しか、いないのに……。", "zh": "不。老是说“但是”，这样可不行呢。\n明明只有我……只有我一个人在的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4af8d788986b382f3f2e19d73b82d523ea5db45bdef07af635cb4aab89d2fb8b", "ja": "わ、わかりました。私だけで、だだ、大丈夫ですっ。\nゴールデンでもポメラニアンでも、どんとこいですぅ！", "zh": "好、好吧。我一个人也、也没问题的！\n不管是金毛还是博美，我都能应付得来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6c1f199b40f7e1eb4285e6c53bc8a58bcaf95b00c4288afa99cce53675337f90", "ja": "おおっ、思った以上の心意気……！\n助かるよ。ありがとう。", "zh": "哦哦，这份干劲比我想象中还要足……！\n帮大忙了。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "605b00cf1dd8a4f4027e853ac55adc8de43b6908d993f83fb74abf168a246005", "ja": "いえ……みんな忙しいのは、公演に向けて\nレッスンもお仕事も、すごく頑張ってるからで……。", "zh": "不是……大家之所以这么忙，是因为为了公演，训练和工作都非常努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d9ac673501d62dea7e000f97ede20505b1e163766c839fda472c1e9e504d4920", "ja": "そんな公演があるんだよって、たくさんの人に\n知ってほしいのは……みんな、同じ気持ちですから。", "zh": "因为大家都有同样的心情，都希望让更多人知道有这样一场公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1012_p", "source_sha256": "214a9ed76615b27f763ccb8b6f5b9aa793de0025c4b738dfeac9dbc075a40880", "ja": "うん、さすが雪歩だ。頼もしいよ。", "zh": "嗯，真不愧是雪步。很靠得住哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "357329a8f9e60bc2ad6a848283d1246ace3024660efe69cc2f61f0d781ccab86", "ja": "と、とんでもないですぅ！　たぶん、アイドルになった\nばかりの頃なら、絶対無理ですって言ってました。", "zh": "没、没那回事！要是刚成为偶像那会儿，我肯定会说绝对做不到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c865f320466e42d3146cad43289b67733884185e641a510130a19b21a0d762fb", "ja": "怖いものがいっぱいで、特に男の人と犬が怖くて、\nそばを通り抜けることもできなくて……。", "zh": "害怕的东西有好多，尤其是男人和狗特别可怕，\n甚至连从旁边走过去都做不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1015_p", "source_sha256": "08b50b873bae0e0d96b02338da99e8411ac9289df4da518e074b7add9da70574", "ja": "（そういえば……出会ったばかりの頃は、\n何かと警戒されてたっけ……）", "zh": "（说起来……刚认识的时候，她还挺警惕我的来着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16ea49a9c9562a183b071ec2de4f4c1dcb96d9b85abdb7b46a6692f50dff7036", "ja": "なんでも人と比べて、自信とかぜんぜんなくて、\nなにかあるとすぐ穴を掘って隠れようとして……。", "zh": "总是喜欢拿自己和别人比较，完全没有自信，稍微遇到点什么事就想挖个洞躲起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "79ee26b5c04cca196ee986531172a22cab66c36e1a0a39fe81769c18d52a330b", "ja": "いつでも弱音ばっかりで、\nダメダメでひんそーでちんちくりんで…………はっ！", "zh": "总是净说丧气话，\n又没用又干瘪又矮冬瓜…………啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1831fd7c55376884023ed2977ef5279fdcf1f66eea57c3402fb003adc1ecad7a", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n私、今もあんまり変わってないかもですぅ！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我现在，说不定也没怎么变呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ed89193aa93b29b870d3fc9ce816397d94546d8f0018a652237e9f6b54964e00", "ja": "いやいや、全然違うよ。こんなに近くで話せてるし、\nゴールデンの番組にも一人で出る決意ができる。", "zh": "不不，完全不一样哦。不仅能离得这么近跟我说话，\n而且还能下定决心一个人去上黄金档的节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1020_p", "source_sha256": "33d8e6516944799e2f860f01bf97bf5b7f3f64b3c2af7dba3024500608a6295f", "ja": "しかも自分だけじゃなくて、みんなの思いも背負って。\n……そんなこと、なかなかできないと思うな。", "zh": "而且背负的不只是自己的心意，还有大家的心意。\n……我觉得，这种事可不是轻易就能做到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7cf5ef6a8b0ec091394a8b2061033c397cb4b6bd2f6e06d81a4459de18f12177", "ja": "だから今の雪歩は、少しもダメダメじゃない。\nむしろ、うちの自慢の、立派なアイドルだ！", "zh": "所以现在的雪步，一点也不差劲。\n不如说，她可是我们引以为傲的出色偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2e878802b6ccf333437bc7556aa07e36b39ccdda03c51aaae4e770397d7aa366", "ja": "あ、あの……ありがとう、ございますぅ……。\nでも、それも765プロのみんながいたから……。", "zh": "啊，那个……谢、谢谢您……。\n可是，那也是因为有了765制作人和大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "149ee89472a7ca7185ca07ce7519af08027ed1a09a08de52ad13b75b492dfccd", "ja": "{$P$}がいたからです。\nだから……、だから私、頑張りますね。", "zh": "都是因为有{$P$}。\n所以……所以，我会努力的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "838c04aa9b7d147a744f6b67d8d545f2e147946a91dfd7ea2bf6353fa800d17d", "ja": "みんなの頑張りを、全部、たくさん届けられるように。\n……誰よりも立派に、全国に告知してみせますぅ！", "zh": "为了把大家的努力全部、尽可能多地传达出去。\n……我会比任何人都出色地向全国宣传的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_004yuk_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_004yuk_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4906f6ac0696f543f6e84d13d2d00acc2a38f65f915bbb24af4877e8c24fab4a", "ja": "ああ！　頼りにしてるぞ、雪歩！", "zh": "啊！就靠你了，雪步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
